# fixedbugs, defect 2335, 2026-11-08: both fields named, out of the declared
# order, and a third label naming no field. It was told the rule of naming
# every field, which it does; each label at fault is told instead, `a` after
# `b` and `c`, which names nothing.
record R
    a: i64
    b: i64

function main()
    r = R(b: 2, a: 1, c: 3)  #~ wrong_label wrong_label
    print(r.a)
